<title>USA: David White Inc Q4 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>David White Inc Q4 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>GERMANTOWN, Wis. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.21     loss	 $1.55</p>
<p> Net profit		    93     loss	   745</p>
<p> Revs			 3,087		    3,019</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.72     loss	 $1.75</p>
<p> Net profit		   327     loss	   852</p>
<p> Revs			13,372		   15,278</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1995 and full-year 1995 losses related to unspecified one-time charges on termination of pension plan and environmental compliance issue. Loss for 1995 also included unspecified goodwill write-off associated with sale of 90 percent interest in Swiss firm.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
